<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to McomMall!</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #ea580c;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666666;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Welcome to McomMall!</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Hi {{name}},</h2>
      <p>Welcome to McomMall! We are so excited to have you on board.</p>
      <p>You can now start earning points and redeeming them for exciting rewards.</p>
      <p>Thanks,</p>
      <p>The McomMall Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; 2025 McomMall. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
